# --- Model weights ---
# DQN weights are 150-250 MB each (saved as whole-object pickles rather than
# state_dict), so they are not tracked. The SB3 PPO .zip files are only ~150 KB
# each and small enough to commit if you want to ship them — uncomment to skip.
*.pth
# *.zip

# --- Python / Jupyter ---
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.venv/
venv/

# --- Editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# --- NOTE: tensorboard/ directories ARE tracked ---
# They hold the training logs the READMEs quote (about 5 MB total). Delete this
# note and add `tensorboard/` above if you would rather not ship them.
